1
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:27,600
Some friends come with a happy ending.

2
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:49,200
Friends with Benefits is a romance, comedy film directed by Will Gluck.

3
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:10,800
Dylan is done with relationships.

4
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:32,400
Jamie decides to stop buying into the Hollywood clichés of true love.

5
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:54,000
When the two become friends they decide to try something new and take advantage of
their mutual attraction - but without any emotional attachment.

6
00:26:09,600 --> 00:26:15,600
Dylan Harper, played by Justin Timberlake.

7
00:30:31,200 --> 00:30:37,200
Jamie Rellis, played by Mila Kunis.

8
00:34:52,800 --> 00:34:58,800
Annie Harper, played by Jenna Elfman.

9
00:39:14,400 --> 00:39:20,400
Lorna, played by Patricia Clarkson.

10
00:43:36,000 --> 00:43:42,000
Tommy Bollinger, played by Woody Harrelson.

11
00:47:57,600 --> 00:48:03,600
Mr. Harper, played by Richard Jenkins.

12
00:52:19,200 --> 00:52:25,200
Friends with Benefits is a 2011 American romantic comedy film directed by
Will Gluck and starring Justin Timberlake and Mila Kunis.

13
00:56:40,800 --> 00:56:46,800
The film features Patricia Clarkson, Jenna Elfman, Bryan Greenberg, Nolan
Gould, Richard Jenkins, and Woody Harrelson in supporting roles.

14
01:01:02,400 --> 01:01:08,400
The plot revolves around Dylan Harper (Timberlake) and Jamie Rellis (Kunis), who meet in New York
City, and naively believe adding sex to their friendship will not lead to complications.

15
01:05:24,000 --> 01:05:30,000
Over time, they begin to develop deep feelings for each other,
only to deny it each time they are together.

16
01:09:45,600 --> 01:09:51,600
Principal casting for Friends with Benefits took place over a
three-month period from April to July 2010.

17
01:14:07,200 --> 01:14:13,200
Gluck reworked the original script and plot shortly
after casting Timberlake and Kunis.

18
01:18:28,800 --> 01:18:34,800
Filming began in New York City on July 20, 2010, and
concluded in Los Angeles in September 2010.

19
01:22:50,400 --> 01:22:56,400
Screen Gems distributed the film, which was released
in North America on July 22, 2011.

20
01:27:12,000 --> 01:27:18,000
Friends with Benefits received positive reviews from critics upon release,
most of whom praised the chemistry between the lead actors.

21
01:31:33,600 --> 01:31:39,600
The film emerged as a commercial success at the box office, grossing
$149.5 million worldwide, against a budget of $35 million.

22
01:35:55,200 --> 01:36:01,200
It was nominated for two People's Choice Awards—Favorite Comedy Movie, and Favorite Comedic
Movie Actress (Kunis)—and two Teen Choice Awards for Timberlake and Kunis.

23
01:40:16,800 --> 01:40:22,800
The film explores themes of new york city, friendship, job
interview, dementia, alzheimer's disease.

24
01:44:38,400 --> 01:44:44,400
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
